DRILL -- EXERCISES IN APL, MADE AT RANDOM AND MARKED.

   SHOW N      PRINT N EXERCISES, EACH WITH ITS ANSWER.

THE DRILL ITSELF, WHICH ASKS AND MARKS, IS NOT HERE YET.
MON AND DYA ARE THE GLYPHS IT DRAWS ON, ONE-ARGUMENT AND
TWO-ARGUMENT; AN EXERCISE IS ONE OF THEM ON SMALL WHOLE
NUMBERS, SCALARS OR VECTORS, CHOSEN SO THAT THE ANSWER IS
WHOLE WHERE THE FUNCTION ALLOWS.
